    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About this game</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506070/extras/068864ba1d16886a80fc1848de1e6519.avif?t=1749319227\" data-has-big width=800 height=238 /></span> <strong>Discover the truth behind your lineage</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are <strong>Teios</strong>\u2014a young apprentice in the outlawed art of summoning. After narrowly escaping the Empire\u2019s soldiers who came for your grandfather, you begin a journey across dangerous lands to discover the truth behind your lineage. But you won\u2019t walk this road alone. Along the way, you'll forge friendships, battle terrifying foes, explore ancient temples, and challenge the rule of an emperor who fears what you might become.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506070/extras/cd88e4d4a766b4c6899cbba2696a79b1.poster.avif?t=1749319227\" width=674 height=294 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506070/extras/cd88e4d4a766b4c6899cbba2696a79b1.webm?t=1749319227\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506070/extras/cd88e4d4a766b4c6899cbba2696a79b1.mp4?t=1749319227\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>Embark on an epic adventure, with striking hand-drawn art, stunning environments, and a lore-rich world. Explore freely, solve puzzles your own way, and uncover the truth behind a forbidden legacy in a world where nothing is quite what it seems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Teios\u2019 Journey </strong>offers a fresh metroidvania experience, where physics-based puzzles meet dynamic exploration and strategic combat. Play solo, or with a friend, as a companion in your Journey. Unlock new abilities, traverse interconnected regions, and discover secrets hidden behind every obstacle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506070/extras/9d6e24a2aeec769e4c1afd66246f869e.poster.avif?t=1749319227\" width=640 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506070/extras/9d6e24a2aeec769e4c1afd66246f869e.webm?t=1749319227\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506070/extras/9d6e24a2aeec769e4c1afd66246f869e.mp4?t=1749319227\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Physics-based gameplay</strong> \u2013 Use tools, objects, and your imagination to solve puzzles in clever, open-ended ways.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Co-op:</strong> Play with a friend on the same screen. Your partner can join or leave at any time to share the adventure with you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic combat</strong> \u2013 Fight beasts, golems, mercenaries, and massive bosses with your own evolving skills and summons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Summoning system</strong> \u2013 Collect ancient relics and combine them to create unique summons and magical tools.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survival meets storytelling</strong> \u2013 Camp in deserts, explore caves, or sail to distant islands as you uncover lost truths.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Legendary side quests</strong> \u2013 Aid travelers, recover lost relics, and shape your reputation across the land.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506070/extras/cf55993949906a61417f2cb8a01e49ef.poster.avif?t=1749319227\" width=800 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506070/extras/cf55993949906a61417f2cb8a01e49ef.webm?t=1749319227\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506070/extras/cf55993949906a61417f2cb8a01e49ef.mp4?t=1749319227\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to forge your own legend?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About this game</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506070/extras/068864ba1d16886a80fc1848de1e6519.avif?t=1749319227\" data-has-big width=800 height=238 /></span> <strong>Discover the truth behind your lineage</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are <strong>Teios</strong>\u2014a young apprentice in the outlawed art of summoning. After narrowly escaping the Empire\u2019s soldiers who came for your grandfather, you begin a journey across dangerous lands to discover the truth behind your lineage. But you won\u2019t walk this road alone. Along the way, you'll forge friendships, battle terrifying foes, explore ancient temples, and challenge the rule of an emperor who fears what you might become.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506070/extras/cd88e4d4a766b4c6899cbba2696a79b1.poster.avif?t=1749319227\" width=674 height=294 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506070/extras/cd88e4d4a766b4c6899cbba2696a79b1.webm?t=1749319227\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506070/extras/cd88e4d4a766b4c6899cbba2696a79b1.mp4?t=1749319227\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>Embark on an epic adventure, with striking hand-drawn art, stunning environments, and a lore-rich world. Explore freely, solve puzzles your own way, and uncover the truth behind a forbidden legacy in a world where nothing is quite what it seems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Teios\u2019 Journey </strong>offers a fresh metroidvania experience, where physics-based puzzles meet dynamic exploration and strategic combat. Play solo, or with a friend, as a companion in your Journey. Unlock new abilities, traverse interconnected regions, and discover secrets hidden behind every obstacle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506070/extras/9d6e24a2aeec769e4c1afd66246f869e.poster.avif?t=1749319227\" width=640 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506070/extras/9d6e24a2aeec769e4c1afd66246f869e.webm?t=1749319227\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506070/extras/9d6e24a2aeec769e4c1afd66246f869e.mp4?t=1749319227\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Physics-based gameplay</strong> \u2013 Use tools, objects, and your imagination to solve puzzles in clever, open-ended ways.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Co-op:</strong> Play with a friend on the same screen. Your partner can join or leave at any time to share the adventure with you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic combat</strong> \u2013 Fight beasts, golems, mercenaries, and massive bosses with your own evolving skills and summons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Summoning system</strong> \u2013 Collect ancient relics and combine them to create unique summons and magical tools.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survival meets storytelling</strong> \u2013 Camp in deserts, explore caves, or sail to distant islands as you uncover lost truths.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Legendary side quests</strong> \u2013 Aid travelers, recover lost relics, and shape your reputation across the land.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506070/extras/cf55993949906a61417f2cb8a01e49ef.poster.avif?t=1749319227\" width=800 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506070/extras/cf55993949906a61417f2cb8a01e49ef.webm?t=1749319227\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506070/extras/cf55993949906a61417f2cb8a01e49ef.mp4?t=1749319227\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to forge your own legend?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
